{"evidence_id": "ev_SHIH_0001_0171000_0196000", "source_evidence_local_id": "e018", "video_id": "SHIH_0001", "start_ms": 171000, "end_ms": 196000, "transcript_raw": "1966年在上海宝山县顾村镇一个坟墓中出土的镶铜，是朱瑛的代表作。作品生动刻画了东汉刘陈阮诏入天台山巧遇神仙的故事，画中山水古松青藤仙草鹤鹿神仙，无不惟妙惟肖，神韵俱佳。", "transcript_reviewed": null, "visual_description_raw": "出土竹刻香筒作品特写画面", "visual_description_reviewed": null, "speaker_role": "旁白", "entities_candidate": {"projects": ["嘉定竹刻"], "people": ["朱缨"], "places": ["上海宝山县顾村镇", "天台山"], "materials": ["竹", "铜"], "tools": [], "techniques": [], "artifacts": ["出土镶铜竹刻（朱缨代表作）"]}, "frame_ids": [176000, 183500, 191000], "frame_paths": ["media/keyframes/000176000.jpg", "media/keyframes/000183500.jpg", "media/keyframes/000191000.jpg"], "quality_flags": ["person_name_unverified"], "uncertainties": ["“镶铜”表述不完整，无法确认具体器物名称；人名“朱瑛”写法无法确认"], "confirmed_normalizations": [{"from": "朱瑛", "to": "朱缨"}], "review_status": "needs_review"}
{"evidence_id": "ev_SHIH_0001_0196000_0210000", "source_evidence_local_id": "e019", "video_id": "SHIH_0001", "start_ms": 196000, "end_ms": 210000, "transcript_raw": "朱瑛的儿子朱志铮，号三松善画远山淡石丛竹枯木，风格接近元代大师倪云林。", "transcript_reviewed": null, "visual_description_raw": "古人物画像画面", "visual_description_reviewed": null, "speaker_role": "旁白", "entities_candidate": {"projects": ["嘉定竹刻"], "people": ["朱缨", "朱志铮（朱三松）", "倪云林"], "places": [], "materials": ["竹"], "tools": [], "techniques": [], "artifacts": []}, "frame_ids": [203000], "frame_paths": ["media/keyframes/000203000.jpg"], "quality_flags": ["person_name_unverified"], "uncertainties": ["人名“朱瑛”“朱志铮”写法无法确认"], "confirmed_normalizations": [{"from": "朱瑛", "to": "朱缨"}], "review_status": "needs_review"}
{"evidence_id": "ev_SHIH_0001_0210000_0250000", "source_evidence_local_id": "e020", "video_id": "SHIH_0001", "start_ms": 210000, "end_ms": 250000, "transcript_raw": "朱三松是一位多才多艺的艺术家，古遗园中小云兜的叠山植树就出于他之手。三松的竹刻作品简洁精雅、古朴淳厚，刀法更加神妙，画面意境高远。他的创作态度极为严谨，每件作品都要经过长期斟酌反复推敲精雕细琢，历经数月才告完成。因此三松的作品每件都是艺术珍品，他的成就超过了祖父朱赫父亲朱茵，被誉为竹刻史上最杰出的名家之一。", "transcript_reviewed": null, "visual_description_raw": "古猗园假山画面、朱三松竹刻作品特写画面", "visual_description_reviewed": null, "speaker_role": "旁白", "entities_candidate": {"projects": ["嘉定竹刻"], "people": ["朱三松", "朱鹤", "朱缨"], "places": ["古猗园"], "materials": ["竹"], "tools": ["刻刀"], "techniques": [], "artifacts": ["朱三松竹刻作品"]}, "frame_ids": [218000, 230000, 242000], "frame_paths": ["media/keyframes/000218000.jpg", "media/keyframes/000230000.jpg", "media/keyframes/000242000.jpg"], "quality_flags": ["asr_needs_review", "person_name_unverified"], "uncertainties": ["人名“朱赫”“朱茵”与前文表述不一致，无法确认正确写法"], "confirmed_normalizations": [{"from": "朱赫", "to": "朱鹤"}, {"from": "朱茵", "to": "朱缨"}], "review_status": "needs_review"}
