{"evidence_id": "ev_SHIH_0001_0272000_0290000", "source_evidence_local_id": "e022", "video_id": "SHIH_0001", "start_ms": 272000, "end_ms": 290000, "transcript_raw": "嘉定竹刻历史悠久，其制作过程相对于其他材质的雕刻也更为复杂，受竹材本身的限制，竹人们必须因材施雕，所以竹客从第一步的选材就尤为讲究。", "transcript_reviewed": null, "visual_description_raw": "手用刻刀雕刻竹材、堆放的竹材画面", "visual_description_reviewed": null, "speaker_role": "旁白", "entities_candidate": {"projects": ["嘉定竹刻"], "people": [], "places": [], "materials": ["竹材"], "tools": ["刻刀"], "techniques": ["因材施雕"], "artifacts": []}, "frame_ids": [275600, 281000, 286400], "frame_paths": ["media/keyframes/000275600.jpg", "media/keyframes/000281000.jpg", "media/keyframes/000286400.jpg"], "quality_flags": [], "uncertainties": [], "confirmed_normalizations": [], "review_status": "auto_generated"}
{"evidence_id": "ev_SHIH_0001_0290000_0326000", "source_evidence_local_id": "e023", "video_id": "SHIH_0001", "start_ms": 290000, "end_ms": 326000, "transcript_raw": "今天挑一个好的，接下来你就大的，最长的呃，就要平整的，就是不要这样弯弯曲曲的，那个你把握能够有多少票跳多少，量一下有10公分，最少要15寸哦。01年的了，还01年的，我不能用的，太老太老了，太老这个啊，这个大的。那这根竹子呢，比较直它的优点是很很平直的，两三年的竹子应该是刚好用好，就这根吧。", "transcript_reviewed": null, "visual_description_raw": "两人在竹林选竹、指认竹材的画面", "visual_description_reviewed": null, "speaker_role": "竹刻艺人", "entities_candidate": {"projects": ["嘉定竹刻"], "people": [], "places": ["竹林"], "materials": ["竹材"], "tools": [], "techniques": [], "artifacts": []}, "frame_ids": [297200, 308000, 318800], "frame_paths": ["media/keyframes/000297200.jpg", "media/keyframes/000308000.jpg", "media/keyframes/000318800.jpg"], "quality_flags": ["asr_needs_review"], "uncertainties": ["部分口语表述模糊，如“有多少票跳多少”语义无法确认"], "confirmed_normalizations": [], "review_status": "needs_review"}
